stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Invalid : code is not 8, 12, 13 or 14 digits
    Idle --> Loading : valid code
    Loading --> Found : name received
    Loading --> NotInDatabase : backend answers 404
    Loading --> LookupFailed : other backend error
    Loading --> NetworkError : no connection
    Found --> [*] : scanner returns the name
    Invalid --> Idle : scan or type again
    NotInDatabase --> Idle : scan or type again
    LookupFailed --> Idle : scan or type again
    NetworkError --> Idle : scan or type again
